Electron adaptation notes (43-x-y):
Toggles.h/.cpp: the Uint/Sint toggles were inserted without the unrelated VulkanSplitBufferTextureCopyForArrayLayers / GLUseArrayLengthFromImmediate neighbours that M150 lacks. BlitTextureToBuffer.cpp: M150 has no C++ Params struct at the insertion point, so only the new kEncode* constants were inserted there. CommandBufferGL.cpp: texture->GetHandle() and static_cast are used to match M150, and CheckFramebufferComplete() (not present on M150) was replaced by an inline glCheckFramebufferStatus() check that fails the copy the same way.

